e\nper-COC sharing check against every row in categoryoptioncombo, regardless\nof whether the combo could ever actually be an attribute option combo. On\ninstances with no ATTRIBUTE-type category combos, only the single default\nCOC is ever a valid AOC, yet the CTE paid for the sharing-check subquery\nacross every combo in the system.\n\nScope the CTE's candidate rows to category combos flagged ATTRIBUTE plus\nthe \"default\" special case, matching the actual definition of a data set's\nattribute category combo (DataSet.categoryCombo must be ATTRIBUTE-typed;\nenforced going forward, not just assumed).\n\nTwo existing test fixtures (DataExportServiceExportTest,\nDataValueSetExportAccessControlTest) assigned a DISAGGREGATION-typed\ncombo as a data set's category combo, which the new scoping correctly\nexcludes; both are updated to use an ATTRIBUTE-typed combo, matching how\ndata sets are meant to be configured. DataExportQueryBuilderTest's\nliteral-SQL test and its regression guard against a per-row correlated\nNOT EXISTS are updated for the new CTE body.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"0a15f4ef5e51567bb4941dafb18c69e23629b59a","tree_id":"cd7f7ebebb80ad645e5f65a7404f07d7fe1a8c92","timestamp":"2026-09-16T07:31:07Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/foll